SNES Emulator - Mobile Application

Version: 1.0.0
Platform: Android
Architecture: ARM64

Features:
- Full SNES (Super Nintendo Entertainment System) emulation
- Support for ROM files (.smc, .sfc, .zip)
- High-performance CPU/GPU emulation
- Save state functionality
- Game controller support
- Adjustable graphics filters

Installation:
1. Download snes-emulator.apk
2. Enable "Unknown Sources" in Android settings
3. Open the APK file to install
4. Launch the application and load your SNES ROM files

System Requirements:
- Android 8.0 or higher
- 2GB RAM minimum
- 100MB free storage

License: Open Source